<title>USA: Ameritech acquires Masada Security.</title>
<headline>Ameritech acquires Masada Security.</headline>
<dateline>CHICAGO 1997-06-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>Ameritech Corp, the communications company, said Thursday it has purchased the security monitoring assets of Masada Security Inc, based in Birmingham, Alabama.</p>
<p>Financial terms were not disclosed.</p>
<p>The purchased assets include the company's security contracts for commercial and residential accounts; offices and branch locations, as well as a central monitoring facility in Birmingham.</p>
<p>Ameritech shares closed down 3/4 at 70-5/8 Thursday.</p>
<p>((Chicago newsdesk, 312-408-8787))</p>
</text>
